<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-011-A habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.495769" lon="-121.076534"><name>SC26-011-A</name><cmt>SC26-011</cmt><desc>Estero rock high Distinct high point in nearly continuous rough seafloor. Terrain A 89/100; not catch probability. Center 137 ft; nearby 130–171 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional point-specific flag from this screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-101</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.49889308553979" lon="-121.07739662528655"/><trkpt lat="35.49880648249241" lon="-121.07761916953511"/><trkpt lat="35.498085553865735" lon="-121.0776363517441"/><trkpt lat="35.49808028433515" lon="-121.07730576043333"/><trkpt lat="35.497809936128306" lon="-121.07731220471076"/><trkpt lat="35.49800070638887" lon="-121.0779690905051"/><trkpt lat="35.49827105469149" lon="-121.07796264838323"/><trkpt lat="35.49854842652308" lon="-121.07839699729642"/><trkpt lat="35.49846182156086" lon="-121.07861953958852"/><trkpt lat="35.497919369258085" lon="-121.07852222248228"/><trkpt lat="35.497924635435055" lon="-121.07885281336998"/><trkpt lat="35.498198494198036" lon="-121.07906676893744"/><trkpt lat="35.49739973128979" lon="-121.07985745793796"/><trkpt lat="35.496491551318336" lon="-121.07943812918671"/><trkpt lat="35.4965020